#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:123
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Configuring FreeBSD on Parallels"
msgstr "在 Parallels 中配置 FreeBSD"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:126
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After FreeBSD has been successfully installed on macOS(R) X with Parallels, "
"there are a number of configuration steps that can be taken to optimize the "
"system for virtualized operation."
msgstr "在 macOS(R) X 上通过 Parallels 成功安装 FreeBSD 后，可以执行若干配置步骤来优化系统的虚拟化运行。"

#. type: .procedure
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:129
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:242
msgid "Set Boot Loader Variables"
msgstr "设定Boot Loader变数"

#. type: .procedure
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:132
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The most important step is to reduce the `kern.hz` tunable to reduce the CPU "
"utilization of FreeBSD under the Parallels environment.  This is "
"accomplished by adding the following line to [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf#:"
msgstr "最重要的步骤是降低 `kern.hz` 可调参数，以减少 FreeBSD 在 Parallels 环境中的 CPU 使用率。为此，请将以下行添加到 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf#："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:136
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:249
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "kern.hz=100\n"
msgstr "kern.hz=100\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:140
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Without this setting, an idle FreeBSD Parallels guest will use roughly 15% "
"of the CPU of a single processor iMac(R).  After this change the usage will "
"be closer to 5%."
msgstr "如果不进行此设置，空闲的 FreeBSD Parallels 客户机大约会占用单处理器 iMac(R) 15% 的 CPU。完成此更改后，使用率将接近 5%。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:142
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If installing FreeBSD 14.0 or later, and CPU utilization is still high, add "
"the following additional line to [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf#:"
msgstr ""
"要确保该模块在重启后会加载，可加入下行到<filename>/boot/loader.conf</"
"filename>："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:146
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "debug.acpi.disabled=\"ged\"\n"
msgstr "debug.acpi.disabled=\"ged\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:148
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:254
msgid "Create a New Kernel Configuration File"
msgstr "建立新核心配置文件"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:151
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All SCSI, FireWire, and USB device drivers can be removed from a custom "
"kernel configuration file.  Parallels provides a virtual network adapter "
"used by the man:ed[4] driver, so all network devices except for man:ed[4] "
"and man:miibus[4] can be removed from the kernel."
msgstr "可以从自定义内核配置文件中移除所有 SCSI、FireWire 和 USB 设备驱动程序。Parallels 提供了由 man:ed[4] 驱动程序使用的虚拟网络适配器，因此可以从内核中移除除 man:ed[4] 和 man:miibus[4] 之外的所有网络设备。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:152
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:258
msgid "Configure Networking"
msgstr "设定网络"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:156
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The most basic networking setup uses DHCP to connect the virtual machine to "
"the same local area network as the host Mac(R).  This can be accomplished by "
"adding `ifconfig_ed0=\"DHCP\"` to [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#.  More advanced "
"networking setups are described in crossref:advanced-networking[advanced-"
"networking,Advanced Networking]."
msgstr "最基本的网络配置使用 DHCP 将虚拟机连接到与宿主 Mac(R) 相同的局域网。为此，可以将 `ifconfig_ed0=\"DHCP\"` 添加到 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#。有关更高级的网络配置，请参阅 crossref:advanced-networking[advanced-networking,高级网络]。"

