#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:275
#, fuzzy
msgid "The xf86 packages are only available for x86 FreeBSD guests."
msgstr "xf86 软件包仅适用于 x86 FreeBSD 客户机。"

