#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:308
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For running Xorg, make sure to set *VBoxSVGA* for the Screen setting of the "
"Display section in the virtual machine configuration before installing the "
"Guest Additions.  Do not select VMSVGA as that targets VMware guests and is "
"not usable on FreeBSD.  It causes Xorg to not run correctly.  VBoxSVGA does "
"not have this problem and executes X11 without errors."
msgstr "要运行 Xorg，请在安装客户机增强功能之前，于虚拟机配置的 Display 部分中将 Screen 设置为 *VBoxSVGA*。不要选择 VMSVGA，因为它面向 VMware 客户机，无法在 FreeBSD 上使用；它会导致 Xorg 无法正常运行。VBoxSVGA 不存在此问题，可以无错误地运行 X11。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:312
msgid "These commands are run in the FreeBSD guest."
msgstr "以下指令均是在FreeBSD客端中执行。"

