#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:726
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"On FreeBSD, an initial QEMU installation can be somewhat slow.  This is "
"because the emulator writes filesystem formatting and metadata during the "
"disk first use.  Subsequent operations are generally much faster."
msgstr "在 FreeBSD 上，首次安装 QEMU 时可能会比较慢。这是因为模拟器首次使用磁盘时会写入文件系统格式信息和元数据。后续操作通常会快得多。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:729
#, fuzzy
msgid "During the installation there are several points to note:"
msgstr "安装过程中需要注意以下几点："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:732
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Select to use UFS as the filesystem.  ZFS does not perform well with small "
"memory sizes."
msgstr "选择使用 UFS 作为文件系统。内存较小时，ZFS 的性能不佳。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:734
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For networking use DHCP.  If desired, configure IPv6 if supported by the "
"local LAN."
msgstr "网络使用 DHCP。如果需要，且本地 LAN 支持 IPv6，也可以配置 IPv6。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:735
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When adding the default user, ensure they are a member of the *wheel* group."
msgstr "添加默认用户时，请确保该用户属于 *wheel* 组。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:737
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "When the installation is finished, reboot into the newly installed "
#| "FreeBSD virtual machine."
msgid ""
"Once the installation completes, the virtual machine reboots into the newly "
"installed FreeBSD image."
msgstr "当安装完成后，重启将会进入新安装的FreeBSD虚拟机器。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:739
#, fuzzy
msgid "Login as `root` and update the system as follows:"
msgstr "以 `root` 身份登录，然后按如下方式更新系统："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:745
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# freebsd-update fetch\n"
"# freebsd-update install\n"
"# shutdown -r now\n"
msgstr "# freebsd-update fetch\n# freebsd-update install\n# shutdown -r now\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:750
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After a successful installation, QEMU will boot the operating system "
"installed on the disk, and not the installation program."
msgstr "成功安装后，QEMU 将启动安装在磁盘上的操作系统，而不是安装程序。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:757
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"QEMU supports a ```-runas``` option.  For added security, include the option "
"\"-runas user_name\" in the script listing above.  See man:qemu[1] for "
"details."
msgstr "QEMU 支持 ```-runas``` 选项。为增强安全性，请在上面的脚本中添加选项 \"-runas user_name\"。详情请参见 man:qemu[1]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:761
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Login as `root` again and add any packages desired.  To utilize the X Window "
"system in the guest, see the section \"Using the X Window System\" below."
msgstr "再次以 `root` 身份登录，并添加所需的软件包。若要在客户机中使用 X Window 系统，请参见下文“使用 X Window 系统”一节。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:763
#, fuzzy
msgid "This completes the setup of the \"left\" VM."
msgstr "至此，“left”虚拟机的设置已完成。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:767
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To install the \"right\" VM, run the following script.  This script has the "
"modifications needed for tap1, format=qcow2, the image filename, the MAC "
"address, and the terminal window name.  If desired, include the \"-runas\" "
"parameter as described in the above note."
msgstr "若要安装“right”虚拟机，请运行以下脚本。此脚本针对 tap1、format=qcow2、映像文件名、MAC 地址和终端窗口名称进行了相应修改。如果需要，请按照上面的说明添加 \"-runas\" 参数。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:782
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"/usr/local/bin/qemu-system-x86_64  -monitor none \\\n"
"  -cpu qemu64 \\\n"
"  -vga cirrus \\\n"
"  -m 4096  -smp 4   \\\n"
"  -cdrom ../ISO/fbsd.iso \\\n"
"  -boot order=cd,menu=on \\\n"
"  -drive if=none,id=drive0,cache=writeback,aio=threads,format=qcow2,discard=unmap,file=../VM/right.qcow2 \\\n"
"  -device virtio-blk-pci,drive=drive0,bootindex=1  \\\n"
"  -netdev tap,id=nd0,ifname=tap1,script=no,downscript=no,br=bridge0 \\\n"
"  -device e1000,netdev=nd0,mac=02:72:69:67:68:74 \\\n"
"  -name \\\"right\\\"\n"
msgstr "/usr/local/bin/qemu-system-x86_64  -monitor none \\\n  -cpu qemu64 \\\n  -vga cirrus \\\n  -m 4096  -smp 4   \\\n  -cdrom ../ISO/fbsd.iso \\\n  -boot order=cd,menu=on \\\n  -drive if=none,id=drive0,cache=writeback,aio=threads,format=qcow2,discard=unmap,file=../VM/right.qcow2 \\\n  -device virtio-blk-pci,drive=drive0,bootindex=1  \\\n  -netdev tap,id=nd0,ifname=tap1,script=no,downscript=no,br=bridge0 \\\n  -device e1000,netdev=nd0,mac=02:72:69:67:68:74 \\\n  -name \\\"right\\\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:786
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the installation is complete, the \"left\" and \"right\" machines can "
"communicate with each other and with the host.  If there are strict firewall "
"rules on the host, consider adding or modifying rules to allow the bridge "
"and tap devices to communicate with each other."
msgstr "安装完成后，“left”和“right”两台计算机便可以彼此通信，也可以与主机通信。如果主机上的防火墙规则较为严格，请考虑添加或修改规则，以允许网桥设备和 tap 设备彼此通信。"

