#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1095
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using the QEMU Monitor to Manage Snapshots"
msgstr "使用 QEMU 监视器管理快照"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1102
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"QEMU's documentation describes several similar concepts when using the term "
"*snapshot*.  There is the `-snapshot` option on the command line which "
"refers to using a drive or portion of a drive to contain a copy of a "
"device.  Then there are the monitor commands `snapshot_blkdev` and "
"`snapshot_blkdev_internal` which describe the actual act of copying the "
"blockdev device.  Finally, there are the monitor commands `savevm`, "
"`loadvm`, and `delvm` commands which refer to creating and saving, loading, "
"or deleting a copy of an entire virtual machine.  Along with the latter, the "
"monitor `info snapshots` command lists out details of recent snapshots."
msgstr "QEMU 文档使用术语 *snapshot* 描述了几个相似的概念。命令行中的 `-snapshot` 选项指使用驱动器或驱动器的一部分来存放设备副本。此外，监视器命令 `snapshot_blkdev` 和 `snapshot_blkdev_internal` 描述了实际复制 blockdev 设备的操作。最后，监视器命令 `savevm`、`loadvm` 和 `delvm` 分别用于创建并保存、加载或删除整个虚拟机的副本。与此相关的监视器命令 `info snapshots` 会列出最近快照的详细信息。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1104
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section will focus on creating, saving, and loading a complete VM image "
"and will use the term *snapshot* for this purpose."
msgstr "本节将重点介绍如何创建、保存和加载完整的 VM 映像，并在此用途下使用术语 *snapshot*。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1106
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To start, recreate the \"left\" VM from scratch, this time using the `qcow2` "
"format."
msgstr "首先，从头重新创建 \"left\" VM，这次使用 `qcow2` 格式。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1114
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% cd ~/QEMU/VM\n"
"% rm left.img\n"
"% qemu-img create -f qcow2 left.qcow2 16G  # Clean file for a new FreeBSD installation.\n"
"% cd ../SCRIPTS\n"
"# /bin/sh left.sh                     # See the below program listing.\n"
msgstr "% cd ~/QEMU/VM\n% rm left.img\n% qemu-img create -f qcow2 left.qcow2 16G  # Clean file for a new FreeBSD installation.\n% cd ../SCRIPTS\n# /bin/sh left.sh                     # See the below program listing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1117
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the installation is complete, reboot, this time using the `-monitor "
"stdio` option to allow use of the monitor."
msgstr "安装完成后，重新启动，并在这次启动时使用 `-monitor stdio` 选项，以便使用监视器。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1134
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# left VM script.\n"
"/usr/local/bin/qemu-system-x86_64  -monitor stdio \\\n"
"  -cpu qemu64 \\\n"
"  -vga std \\\n"
"  -m 4096 \\\n"
"  -smp 4   \\\n"
"  -cdrom ../ISO/fbsd.iso \\\n"
"  -boot order=cd,menu=on \\\n"
"  -blockdev driver=file,aio=threads,node-name=imgleft,filename=../VM/left.qcow2 \\\n"
"  -blockdev driver=qcow2,node-name=drive0,file=imgleft \\\n"
"  -device virtio-blk-pci,drive=drive0,bootindex=1  \\\n"
"  -netdev tap,id=nd0,ifname=tap0,script=no,downscript=no,br=bridge0 \\\n"
"  -device e1000,netdev=nd0,mac=02:20:6c:65:66:74 \\\n"
"  -name \\\"left\\\"\n"
msgstr "# left VM script.\n/usr/local/bin/qemu-system-x86_64  -monitor stdio \\\\\n  -cpu qemu64 \\\\\n  -vga std \\\\\n  -m 4096 \\\\\n  -smp 4   \\\\\n  -cdrom ../ISO/fbsd.iso \\\\\n  -boot order=cd,menu=on \\\\\n  -blockdev driver=file,aio=threads,node-name=imgleft,filename=../VM/left.qcow2 \\\\\n  -blockdev driver=qcow2,node-name=drive0,file=imgleft \\\\\n  -device virtio-blk-pci,drive=drive0,bootindex=1  \\\\\n  -netdev tap,id=nd0,ifname=tap0,script=no,downscript=no,br=bridge0 \\\\\n  -device e1000,netdev=nd0,mac=02:20:6c:65:66:74 \\\\\n  -name \\\\\"left\\\\\"\n"

