#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1177
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Reboot the system, and before FreeBSD starts up, switch to the monitor and "
"enter `stop`.  The VM will stop."
msgstr "重新启动系统，并在 FreeBSD 启动前切换到监视器并输入 `stop`。VM 将停止。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1179
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enter `loadvm` with the tag used above (here `original_install`)."
msgstr "输入 `loadvm`，并指定上面使用的标签（此处为 `original_install`）。"

