"(qemu) cont\n"
msgstr "QEMU 9.0.1 monitor - type 'help' for more information\n(qemu) stop\n(qemu) loadvm original_install\n(qemu) cont\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1190
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Immediately, the VM screen will switch to the exact moment the `savevm` "
"command was entered above.  Note that the VM is still stopped."
msgstr "VM 屏幕会立即切换到上面输入 `savevm` 命令的确切时刻。请注意，VM 仍处于停止状态。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1194
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enter `cont` to start the VM, switch to the editing session on `ttyv1`, and "
