"respond accordingly.  Any other programs running at the time the snapshot "
"was taken should be unaffected."
msgstr "输入 `cont` 启动 VM，切换到 `ttyv1` 上的编辑会话，然后在键盘上输入一个字母。仍处于插入模式的编辑器应会做出相应响应。创建快照时正在运行的其他程序也应不受影响。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1196
#, fuzzy
