"The above steps show how a snapshot can be taken, the system modified, and "
"then \"rolled back\" by restoring the previous snapshot."
msgstr "上述步骤展示了如何创建快照、修改系统，然后通过恢复之前的快照“回滚”。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1200
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
