#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1270
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As before, once `device_add` completes, the FreeBSD kernel recognizes a new "
"USB device, as shown in the lower half of the ."
msgstr "与之前一样，`device_add` 执行完毕后，FreeBSD 内核会识别出新的 USB 设备，如图的下半部分所示。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1273
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Using the new device is shown in crossref:virtualization[qemu-usb-"
"passthrough2,Figure {counter:figure}]."
msgstr "crossref:virtualization[qemu-usb-passthrough2,Figure {counter:figure}] 展示了新设备的使用情况。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1275
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using the Host USB Device via Passthrough"
msgstr "通过直通方式使用主机 USB 设备"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1276
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "qemu-freebsd19.png"
msgstr "qemu-freebsd19.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1281
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the USB device is formatted as a FAT16 or FAT32 filesystem it can be "
"mounted as an MS-DOS(TM) filesystem with man:mount_msdosfs[8] as in the "
"example shown.  The `/etc/hosts` file is copied to the newly mounted drive "
"and checksums are taken to verify the integrity of the file on the USB "
"device.  The device is then unmounted with man:umount[8]."
msgstr "如果 USB 设备格式化为 FAT16 或 FAT32 文件系统，可以像示例中那样使用 man:mount_msdosfs[8] 将其挂载为 MS-DOS(TM) 文件系统。将 `/etc/hosts` 文件复制到新挂载的驱动器，并计算校验和，以验证 USB 设备上该文件的完整性。然后使用 man:umount[8] 卸载设备。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1283
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the USB device is formatted with NTFS it is necessary to install the "
"`fusefs-ntfs` package and use man:ntfs-3g[8] to access the device:"
msgstr "如果 USB 设备格式化为 NTFS，则需要安装 `fusefs-ntfs` 软件包，并使用 man:ntfs-3g[8] 访问设备："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1290
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# pkg install fusefs-ntfs\n"
"# kldload fusefs\n"
"# gpart show da1\n"
"# ntfs-3g /dev/da1s1 /mnt\n"
msgstr "# pkg install fusefs-ntfs\n# kldload fusefs\n# gpart show da1\n# ntfs-3g /dev/da1s1 /mnt\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1292
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Access the drive as needed.  When finished:\n"
msgstr "根据需要访问该驱动器。完成后：\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1294
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# umount /mnt\n"
msgstr "# umount /mnt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1298
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Change the above device identifiers to match the installed hardware.  "
"Consult man:ntfs-3g[8] for additional information on working with NTFS "
"filesystems."
msgstr "将上述设备标识符更改为与已安装硬件相符的值。有关使用 NTFS 文件系统的更多信息，请参阅 man:ntfs-3g[8]。"

