#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1504
msgid "Boot the virtual machine:"
msgstr "启动虚拟机："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1509
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# bhyve -A -H -P -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc -s 2:0,virtio-net,tap0 \\\n"
"    -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./linux.img -l com1,stdio -c 4 -m 1024M linuxguest\n"
msgstr "# bhyve -A -H -P -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc -s 2:0,virtio-net,tap0 \\\n    -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./linux.img -l com1,stdio -c 4 -m 1024M linuxguest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1515
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Linux(R) will now boot in the virtual machine and eventually presents the "
"login prompt.  Login and use the virtual machine.  When finished, reboot the "
"virtual machine to exit bhyve.  Destroy the virtual machine instance:"
msgstr "Linux(R) 现在将在虚拟机中启动，最终显示登录提示符。登录并使用虚拟机。完成后，重新启动虚拟机以退出 bhyve。销毁虚拟机实例："

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1522
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Booting bhyve Virtual Machines with UEFI Firmware"
msgstr "使用 UEFI 固件启动 bhyve 虚拟机"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1526
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In addition to `bhyveload` and `grub-bhyve`, the bhyve hypervisor can also "
"boot virtual machines using the UEFI firmware.  This option may support "
"guest operating systems that are not supported by the other loaders."
msgstr "除了 `bhyveload` 和 `grub-bhyve`，bhyve 虚拟机监控程序还可以使用 UEFI 固件启动虚拟机。此选项可能支持其他加载器不支持的客户机操作系统。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1529
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To make use of the UEFI support in bhyve, first obtain the UEFI firmware "
"images.  This can be done by installing package:sysutils/bhyve-firmware[] "
"port or package."
msgstr "要使用 bhyve 的 UEFI 支持，首先获取 UEFI 固件映像。可以通过安装 package:sysutils/bhyve-firmware[] 移植软件包或软件包来获取。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1532
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With the firmware in place, add the flags `-l bootrom,_/path/to/firmware_` "
"to the bhyve command line.  The actual bhyve command may look like this:"
msgstr "准备好固件后，在 bhyve 命令行中添加标志 `-l bootrom,_/path/to/firmware_`。实际的 bhyve 命令可能如下所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1540
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# bhyve -AHP -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc \\\n"
"  \t-s 2:0,virtio-net,tap1 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./disk.img \\\n"
"\t-s 4:0,ahci-cd,./install.iso -c 4 -m 1024M \\\n"
"\t-l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI.fd \\\n"
"\tguest\n"
msgstr "# bhyve -AHP -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc \\\n  \t-s 2:0,virtio-net,tap1 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./disk.img \\\n\t-s 4:0,ahci-cd,./install.iso -c 4 -m 1024M \\\n\t-l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI.fd \\\n\tguest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1545
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To allow a guest to store UEFI variables, use a variables file appended to "
"the `-l` flag.  Note that bhyve will write guest modifications to the given "
"variables file.  Therefore, be sure to first create a per-guest-copy of the "
"variables template file:"
msgstr "要允许客户机存储 UEFI 变量，请将变量文件附加到 `-l` 标志。请注意，bhyve 会将客户机所做的修改写入指定的变量文件。因此，请务必先为每个客户机创建一份变量模板文件的副本："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1549
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# cp /usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI_VARS.fd /path/to/vm-image/BHYVE_UEFI_VARS.fd\n"
msgstr "# cp /usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI_VARS.fd /path/to/vm-image/BHYVE_UEFI_VARS.fd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1552
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then, add that variables file to the bhyve arguments:"
msgstr "然后，将该变量文件添加到 bhyve 参数中："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1560
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# bhyve -AHP -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc \\\n"
"  \t-s 2:0,virtio-net,tap1 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./disk.img \\\n"
"\t-s 4:0,ahci-cd,./install.iso -c 4 -m 1024M \\\n"
"\t-l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI.fd,/path/to/vm-image/BHYVE_UEFI_VARS.fd \\\n"
"\tguest\n"
msgstr "# bhyve -AHP -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc \\\n  \t-s 2:0,virtio-net,tap1 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./disk.img \\\n\t-s 4:0,ahci-cd,./install.iso -c 4 -m 1024M \\\n\t-l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI.fd,/path/to/vm-image/BHYVE_UEFI_VARS.fd \\\n\tguest\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1566
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some Linux distributions require the use of UEFI variables to store the path "
"for their UEFI boot file (using `linux64.efi` or `grubx64.efi` instead of "
"`bootx64.efi`, for example).  It is therefore recommended to use a variables "
"file for Linux virtual machines to avoid having to manually alter the boot "
"partition files."
msgstr "某些 Linux 发行版需要使用 UEFI 变量来存储其 UEFI 引导文件的路径（例如，使用 `linux64.efi` 或 `grubx64.efi` 而不是 `bootx64.efi`）。因此，建议为 Linux 虚拟机使用变量文件，以免必须手动修改引导分区文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1569
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To view or modify the variables file contents, use man:efivar[8] from the "
"host."
msgstr "要查看或修改变量文件的内容，请在主机上使用 man:efivar[8]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1571
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"package:sysutils/bhyve-firmware[] also contains a CSM-enabled firmware, to "
"boot guests with no UEFI support in legacy BIOS mode:"
msgstr "package:sysutils/bhyve-firmware[] 还包含启用了 CSM 的固件，可在传统 BIOS 模式下启动不支持 UEFI 的客户机："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1579
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# bhyve -AHP -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc \\\n"
"  \t-s 2:0,virtio-net,tap1 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./disk.img \\\n"
"\t-s 4:0,ahci-cd,./install.iso -c 4 -m 1024M \\\n"
"\t-l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI_CSM.fd \\\n"
"\tguest\n"
msgstr "# bhyve -AHP -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc \\\n  \t-s 2:0,virtio-net,tap1 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./disk.img \\\n\t-s 4:0,ahci-cd,./install.iso -c 4 -m 1024M \\\n\t-l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI_CSM.fd \\\n\tguest\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1582
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Graphical UEFI Framebuffer for bhyve Guests"
msgstr "bhyve 客户机的图形 UEFI 帧缓冲区"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1585
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The UEFI firmware support is particularly useful with predominantly "
"graphical guest operating systems such as Microsoft Windows(R)."
msgstr "UEFI 固件支持对于主要采用图形界面的客户机操作系统（如 Microsoft Windows(R)）特别有用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1590
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Support for the UEFI-GOP framebuffer may also be enabled with the `-s 29,"
"fbuf,tcp=_0.0.0.0:5900_` flags.  The framebuffer resolution may be "
"configured with `w=_800_` and `h=_600_`, and bhyve can be instructed to wait "
"for a VNC connection before booting the guest by adding `wait`.  The "
"framebuffer may be accessed from the host or over the network via the VNC "
"protocol.  Additionally, `-s 30,xhci,tablet` can be added to achieve precise "
"mouse cursor synchronization with the host."
msgstr "还可以使用标志 `-s 29,fbuf,tcp=_0.0.0.0:5900_` 启用对 UEFI-GOP 帧缓冲区的支持。可以使用 `w=_800_` 和 `h=_600_` 配置帧缓冲区分辨率，还可以添加 `wait`，指示 bhyve 在启动客户机前等待 VNC 连接。可以通过 VNC 协议从主机本地或经由网络访问帧缓冲区。此外，还可以添加 `-s 30,xhci,tablet`，以实现鼠标光标与主机之间的精确同步。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1592
#, fuzzy
msgid "The resulting bhyve command would look like this:"
msgstr "生成的 bhyve 命令如下所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1602
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# bhyve -AHP -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 31:0,lpc \\\n"
"  \t-s 2:0,virtio-net,tap1 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./disk.img \\\n"
"\t-s 4:0,ahci-cd,./install.iso -c 4 -m 1024M \\\n"
"\t-s 29,fbuf,tcp=0.0.0.0:5900,w=800,h=600,wait \\\n"
"\t-s 30,xhci,tablet \\\n"
"\t-l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI.fd \\\n"
"\tguest\n"
msgstr "# bhyve -AHP -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 31:0,lpc \\\n  \t-s 2:0,virtio-net,tap1 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./disk.img \\\n\t-s 4:0,ahci-cd,./install.iso -c 4 -m 1024M \\\n\t-s 29,fbuf,tcp=0.0.0.0:5900,w=800,h=600,wait \\\n\t-s 30,xhci,tablet \\\n\t-l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI.fd \\\n\tguest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1605
msgid ""
"Note, in BIOS emulation mode, the framebuffer will cease receiving updates "
"once control is passed from firmware to guest operating system."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在 BIOS 仿真模式下，一旦控制权从固件传递到客户机作系统，帧缓冲器将停"
"止接收更新。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1607
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Creating a Microsoft Windows(R) Guest"
msgstr "创建 Microsoft Windows(R) 客户机"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1611
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Setting up a guest for Windows versions 10 or earlier can be done directly "
"from the original installation media and is a relatively straightforward "
"process.  Aside from minimum resource requirements, running Windows as guest "
"requires"
msgstr "可直接使用原始安装介质为 Windows 10 或更早版本设置客户机，整个过程相对简单。除了最低资源要求外，将 Windows 作为客户机运行还需要"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1613
#, fuzzy
msgid "wiring virtual machine memory (flag `-w`) and"
msgstr "为虚拟机内存预留资源（标志 `-w`），并且"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1614
#, fuzzy
msgid "booting with an UEFI bootrom."
msgstr "使用 UEFI 引导 ROM 启动。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1616
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An example for booting a virtual machine guest with a Windows installation "
"ISO:"
msgstr "以下示例使用 Windows 安装 ISO 启动虚拟机客户机："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1630
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"bhyve \\\n"
"      -c 2 \\\n"
"      -s 0,hostbridge \\\n"
"      -s 3,nvme,windows2016.img \\\n"
"      -s 4,ahci-cd,install.iso \\\n"
"      -s 10,virtio-net,tap0 \\\n"
"      -s 31,lpc \\\n"
"      -s 30,xhci,tablet \\\n"
"      -l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI.fd \\\n"
"      -m 8G -H -w \\\n"
"      windows2016\n"
msgstr "bhyve \\\n      -c 2 \\\n      -s 0,hostbridge \\\n      -s 3,nvme,windows2016.img \\\n      -s 4,ahci-cd,install.iso \\\n      -s 10,virtio-net,tap0 \\\n      -s 31,lpc \\\n      -s 30,xhci,tablet \\\n      -l bootrom,/usr/local/share/uefi-firmware/BHYVE_UEFI.fd \\\n      -m 8G -H -w \\\n      windows2016\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1633
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Only one or two VCPUs should be used during installation but this number can "
"be increased once Windows is installed."
msgstr "安装期间应只使用一个或两个 VCPU，但安装 Windows 后可以增加此数量。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1637
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"link:https://github.com/virtio-win/virtio-win-pkg-scripts/blob/master/README."
"md[VirtIO drivers] must be installed to use the defined `virtio-net` network "
"interface.  An alternative is to switch to E1000 (Intel E82545) emulation by "
"changing `virtio-net` to `e1000` in the above command line.  However, "
"performance will be impacted."
msgstr "必须安装 link:https://github.com/virtio-win/virtio-win-pkg-scripts/blob/master/README.md[VirtIO 驱动程序]，才能使用已定义的 `virtio-net` 网络接口。另一种方法是在上述命令行中将 `virtio-net` 改为 `e1000`，以使用 E1000（Intel E82545）模拟。不过，这会影响性能。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1639
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Creating a FreeBSD Guest"
msgid "Creating a Windows 11 Guest"
msgstr "创建 FreeBSD 客户机"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1645
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Beginning with Windows 11, Microsoft introduced a hardware requirement for a "
"TPM 2 module.  bhyve supports passing a hardware TPM through to a guest.  "
"The installation media can be modified to disable the relevant hardware "
"checks.  A detailed description for this process can be found on the link:"
"https://wiki.freebsd.org/bhyve/Windows#iso-remaster[FreeBSD Wiki]."
msgstr "从 Windows 11 开始，Microsoft 引入了 TPM 2 模块的硬件要求。bhyve 支持将硬件 TPM 直通给客户机。可以修改安装介质以禁用相关硬件检查。有关此过程的详细说明，请参阅 link:https://wiki.freebsd.org/bhyve/Windows#iso-remaster[FreeBSD Wiki]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1650
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Modifying Windows installation media and running Windows guests without a "
"TPM module are unsupported by the manufacturer.  Consider the application "
"and use case before implementing such approaches."
msgstr "制造商不支持修改 Windows 安装介质以及在没有 TPM 模块的情况下运行 Windows 客户机。采用这些方法前，请考虑应用程序和使用场景。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1653
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using ZFS with bhyve Guests"
msgstr "在 bhyve 客户机中使用 ZFS"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1657
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If ZFS is available on the host machine, using ZFS volumes instead of disk "
"image files can provide significant performance benefits for the guest VMs.  "
"A ZFS volume can be created by:"
msgstr "如果主机上有 ZFS，与磁盘映像文件相比，使用 ZFS 卷可以显著提升客户机虚拟机的性能。可以通过以下命令创建 ZFS 卷："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1661
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zfs create -V16G -o volmode=dev zroot/linuxdisk0\n"
msgstr "# zfs create -V16G -o volmode=dev zroot/linuxdisk0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1664
#, fuzzy
msgid "When starting the VM, specify the ZFS volume as the disk drive:"
msgstr "启动虚拟机时，将 ZFS 卷指定为磁盘驱动器："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1670
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# bhyve -A -H -P -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc -s 2:0,virtio-net,tap0 \\\n"
"  \t-s3:0,virtio-blk,/dev/zvol/zroot/linuxdisk0 \\\n"
"\t-l com1,stdio -c 4 -m 1024M linuxguest\n"
msgstr "# bhyve -A -H -P -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc -s 2:0,virtio-net,tap0 \\\n  \t-s3:0,virtio-blk,/dev/zvol/zroot/linuxdisk0 \\\n\t-l com1,stdio -c 4 -m 1024M linuxguest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1675
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When using ZFS for the host as well as inside a guest, keep in mind the "
"competing memory pressure of both systems caching the virtual machine's "
"contents.  To alleviate this, consider setting the host's ZFS filesystems to "
"use metadata-only cache.  To do this, apply the following settings to ZFS "
"filesystems on the host, replacing `<name>` with the name of the specific "
"zvol dataset name of the virtual machine."
msgstr "在主机和客户机中都使用 ZFS 时，请注意两个系统缓存虚拟机内容会造成内存竞争。为缓解此问题，可以将主机上的 ZFS 文件系统设置为仅缓存元数据。为此，请将以下设置应用于主机上的 ZFS 文件系统，并将 `<name>` 替换为虚拟机对应的 zvol 数据集名称。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1679
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zfs set primarycache=metadata <name>\n"
msgstr "# zfs set primarycache=metadata <name>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1682
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Managing Virtual Machines"
msgid "Creating a Virtual Machine Snapshot"
msgstr "管理虚拟机"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1688
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Modern hypervisors allow their users to create \"snapshots\" of their state; "
"such a snapshot includes a guest's disk, CPU, and memory contents.  A "
"snapshot can usually be taken independent of whether the guest is running or "
"shut down.  One can then reset and return the virtual machine to the precise "
"state when the snapshot was taken."
msgstr "现代虚拟机监控程序允许用户为系统状态创建“快照”；快照包含客户机的磁盘、CPU 和内存内容。通常，无论客户机正在运行还是已关闭，都可以创建快照。之后可以重置虚拟机，并恢复到创建快照时的精确状态。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1690
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "ZFS Snapshots"
msgstr "ZFS 快照"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1693
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Using ZFS volumes as the backing storage for a virtual machine enables the "
"snapshotting of the guest's disk. For example:"
msgstr "将 ZFS 卷用作虚拟机的后备存储，可以对客户机磁盘创建快照。例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1697
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "zfs snapshot zroot/path/to/zvol@snapshot_name\n"
msgstr "zfs snapshot zroot/path/to/zvol@snapshot_name\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1702
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Though it is possible to snapshot a ZFS volume this way while the guest is "
"running, keep in mind that the contents of the virtual disk may be in an "
"inconsistent state while the guest is active.  It is therefore recommended "
"to first shutdown or pause the guest before executing this command.  Pausing "
"a guest is not supported by default and needs to be enabled first (see "
"crossref:virtualization[virtualization-bhyve-snapshot-builtin,Memory and CPU "
"Snapshots])"
msgstr "虽然客户机运行时也可以这样对 ZFS 卷创建快照，但请注意，客户机处于活动状态时，虚拟磁盘内容可能处于不一致状态。因此，建议先关闭或暂停客户机，再执行此命令。默认情况下不支持暂停客户机，必须先启用此功能（参见 crossref:virtualization[virtualization-bhyve-snapshot-builtin,内存和 CPU 快照]）。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1707
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rolling back a ZFS zvol to a snapshot while a virtual machine is using it "
"may corrupt the file system contents and crash the guest.  All unsaved data "
"in the guest will be lost and modifications since the last snapshot may get "
"destroyed."
msgstr "虚拟机正在使用 ZFS zvol 时将其回滚到快照，可能会损坏文件系统内容并导致客户机崩溃。客户机中所有未保存的数据都会丢失，自上次快照以来所做的修改也可能被销毁。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1710
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A second rollback may be required once the virtual machine is shut down to "
"restore the file system to a useable state.  This in turn will ultimately "
"destroy any changes made after the snapshot."
msgstr "虚拟机关闭后，可能需要再次回滚，才能将文件系统恢复到可用状态。但这最终会销毁快照之后所做的所有更改。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1713
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Memory and CPU Snapshots (Experimental Feature)"
msgstr "内存和 CPU 快照（实验性功能）"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1717
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"As of FreeBSD 13, bhyve has an experimental \"snapshot\" feature for dumping "
"a guest's memory and CPU state to a file and then halting the virtual "
"machine.  The guest can be resumed from the snapshot file contents later."
msgstr "从 FreeBSD 13 开始，bhyve 提供了一项实验性的“快照”功能，可将客户机的内存和 CPU 状态转储到文件中，然后停止虚拟机。之后可以根据快照文件的内容恢复客户机。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1720
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"However, this feature is not enabled by default and requires the system to "
"be rebuilt from source.  See crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-building, "
"Building from Source] for an in-depth description on the process of "
"compiling the kernel with custom options."
msgstr "不过，此功能默认未启用，需要从源代码重新构建系统。有关使用自定义选项编译内核的详细说明，请参阅 crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-building,从源代码构建]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1725
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The functionality is not ready for production use and limited to work for "
"specific virtual machine configurations.  There are multiple limitations:"
msgstr "此功能尚未达到可用于生产环境的状态，并且仅适用于特定的虚拟机配置。它有以下多项限制："

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1727
#, fuzzy
msgid "`nvme` and `virtio-blk` storage backends do not work yet"
msgstr "`nvme` 和 `virtio-blk` 存储后端尚不可用"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1728
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"snapshots are only supported when the guest uses a single kind of each "
"device, i.e. if there is more than one `ahci-hd` disk attached, snapshot "
"creation will fail"
msgstr "只有客户机使用的每种设备各不超过一个时才支持创建快照；也就是说，如果连接了多个 `ahci-hd` 磁盘，快照创建将失败"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1729
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"additionally, the feature may be reasonably stable on Intel, but it probably "
"won't work on AMD CPUs."
msgstr "此外，此功能在 Intel 处理器上可能相当稳定，但很可能无法在 AMD CPU 上运行。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1734
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure the [.filename]#/usr/src# directory is up-to date before taking "
"the following steps. See crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-obtaining-src, "
"Updating the Source] for the detailed procedure how to do this."
msgstr "请确保在执行以下步骤之前，[.filename]#/usr/src# 目录已更新。有关详细步骤，请参阅 crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-obtaining-src,获取源代码]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1737
#, fuzzy
msgid "First, add the following to [.filename]#/etc/src.conf#:"
msgstr ""
"要加载这些新规则，请在<filename>/etc/rc.conf</filename>中添加以下内容："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1743
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"WITH_BHYVE_SNAPHOT=yes\n"
"BHYVE_SNAPSHOT=1\n"
"MK_BHYVE_SNAPSHOT=yes\n"
msgstr "WITH_BHYVE_SNAPHOT=yes\nBHYVE_SNAPSHOT=1\nMK_BHYVE_SNAPSHOT=yes\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1748
#, fuzzy
msgid "If the system was partially or wholly rebuilt, it is recommended to run"
msgstr "如果系统进行了部分或全部重新构建，建议先运行"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1753
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/src\n"
"# make cleanworld\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/src\n# make cleanworld\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1756
#, fuzzy
msgid "before proceeding."
msgstr "然后再继续。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1759
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then follow the steps outlined in the crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-"
"quick-start,\"Quick Start section of the Updating FreeBSD from Source\"] "
"chapter to build and install world and kernel."
msgstr "然后按照 crossref:cutting-edge[updating-src-quick-start,\"从源代码更新 FreeBSD\"章节中的“快速入门”]所述步骤，构建并安装 world 和内核。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1761
#, fuzzy
msgid "To verify successful activation of the snapshot feature, enter"
msgstr "要确认快照功能已成功启用，请输入"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1765
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# bhyvectl --usage\n"
msgstr "# bhyvectl --usage\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1769
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"and check if the output lists a `--suspend` flag.  If the flag is missing, "
"the feature did not activate correctly."
msgstr "并检查输出中是否列出了 `--suspend` 标志。如果缺少该标志，则表示此功能未正确启用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1771
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then, snapshot and suspend a running virtual machine of choice:"
msgstr "然后，对选定的正在运行的虚拟机创建快照并将其暂停："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1775
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# bhyvectl --vm=vmname --suspend=/path/to/snapshot/filename\n"
msgstr "# bhyvectl --vm=vmname --suspend=/path/to/snapshot/filename\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1781
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Provide an absolute path and filename to `--suspend`.  Otherwise, bhyve will "
"write snapshot data to whichever directory bhyve was started from."
msgstr "为 `--suspend` 指定绝对路径和文件名。否则，bhyve 会将快照数据写入其启动时所在的目录。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1784
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure to write the snapshot data to a secure directory.  The generated "
"output contains a full memory dump of the guest and may thus contain "
"sensitive data (i.e. passwords)!"
msgstr "请务必将快照数据写入安全目录。生成的输出包含客户机的完整内存转储，因此可能包含敏感数据（例如密码）！"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1787
#, fuzzy
msgid "This creates three files:"
msgstr "此操作会创建三个文件："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1789
#, fuzzy
msgid "memory snapshot - named like the input to `--suspend`"
msgstr "内存快照——名称与 `--suspend` 的输入相同"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1790
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"kernel file - name like the input to `--suspend` with the suffix [."
"filename]#.kern#"
msgstr "内核文件——名称与 `--suspend` 的输入相同，后缀为 [.filename]#.kern#"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1791
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"metadata - contains meta data about the system state, named with the suffix "
"[.filename]#.meta#"
msgstr "元数据——包含系统状态的元数据，后缀为 [.filename]#.meta#"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1793
#, fuzzy
msgid "To restore a guest from a snapshot, use the `-r` flag with `bhyve`:"
msgstr "要从快照恢复客户机，请在 `bhyve` 中使用 `-r` 标志："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1797
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# bhyve -r /path/to/snapshot/filename\n"
msgstr "# bhyve -r /path/to/snapshot/filename\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1801
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Restoring a guest snapshot on a different CPU architecture will not work.  "
"Generally, attempting to restore on a system not identical to the snapshot "
"creator will likely fail."
msgstr "无法在不同 CPU 架构上恢复客户机快照。通常，尝试在与创建快照的系统不完全相同的系统上恢复也很可能失败。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1803
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Jailing bhyve"
msgstr "在 jail 中运行 bhyve"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1807
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For improved security and separation of virtual machines from the host "
"operating system, it is possible to run bhyve in a jail.  See crossref:"
"jails[,Jails] for an in-depth description of jails and their security "
"benefits."
msgstr "为了增强安全性并将虚拟机与主机操作系统隔离，可以在 jail 中运行 bhyve。有关 jail 及其安全优势的详细说明，请参阅 crossref:jails[,Jail]。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1809
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Creating a Jail for bhyve"
msgstr "为 bhyve 创建 jail"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1812
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"First, create a jail environment. If using a UFS file system, simply run:"
msgstr "首先，创建 jail 环境。如果使用 UFS 文件系统，只需运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1816
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# mkdir -p /jails/bhyve\n"
msgstr "# mkdir -p /jails/bhyve\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1819
#, fuzzy
msgid "If using a crossref:zfs[,ZFS filesystem], use the following commands:"
msgstr "如果使用 crossref:zfs[,ZFS 文件系统]，请运行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1824
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs create zroot/jails\n"
"# zfs create zroot/jails/bhyve\n"
msgstr "# zfs create zroot/jails\n# zfs create zroot/jails/bhyve\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1827
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then create a ZFS zvol for the virtual machine `bhyvevm0`:"
msgstr "然后为虚拟机 `bhyvevm0` 创建 ZFS zvol："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1832
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# zfs create zroot/vms\n"
"# zfs create -V 20G zroot/vms/bhyvevm0\n"
msgstr "# zfs create zroot/vms\n# zfs create -V 20G zroot/vms/bhyvevm0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1835
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If not using ZFS, use the following commands to create a disk image file "
"directly in the jail directory structure:"
msgstr "如果不使用 ZFS，请运行以下命令，直接在 jail 目录结构中创建磁盘映像文件："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1840
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# mkdir /jails/bhyve/vms\n"
"# truncate -s 20G /jails/bhyve/vms/bhyvevm0\n"
msgstr "# mkdir /jails/bhyve/vms\n# truncate -s 20G /jails/bhyve/vms/bhyvevm0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1843
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Download a FreeBSD image, preferably a version equal to or older than the "
"host and extract it into the jail directory:"
msgstr "下载 FreeBSD 映像，最好选择与主机版本相同或更早的版本，并将其解压到 jail 目录中："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1849
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /jails\n"
"# fetch -o base.txz http://ftp.freebsd.org/pub/FreeBSD/releases/amd64/13.2-RELEASE/base.txz\n"
"# tar -C /jails/bhyve -xvf base.txz\n"
msgstr "# cd /jails\n# fetch -o base.txz http://ftp.freebsd.org/pub/FreeBSD/releases/amd64/13.2-RELEASE/base.txz\n# tar -C /jails/bhyve -xvf base.txz\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1854
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Running a higher FreeBSD version in a jail than the host is unsupported (i."
"e. running 14.0-RELEASE in a jail, embedded in a 13.2-RELEASE host)."
msgstr "不支持在 jail 中运行比主机版本更高的 FreeBSD（例如，在 13.2-RELEASE 主机中的 jail 里运行 14.0-RELEASE）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1857
#, fuzzy
msgid "Next, add a devfs ruleset to [.filename]#/etc/devfs.rules#:"
msgstr "接下来，在 [.filename]#/etc/devfs.rules# 中添加一组 devfs 规则："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:1881
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[devfsrules_jail_bhyve=100]\n"
"add include $devfsrules_hide_all\n"
"add include $devfsrules_unhide_login\n"
"add path 'urandom' unhide\n"
"add path 'random' unhide\n"
"add path 'crypto' unhide\n"
"add path 'shm' unhide\n"
"add path 'zero' unhide\n"
"add path 'null' unhide\n"
"add path 'mem' unhide\n"
"add path 'vmm' unhide\n"
"add path 'vmm/*' unhide\n"
"add path 'vmm.io' unhide\n"
"add path 'vmm.io/*' unhide\n"
"add path 'nmdmbhyve*' unhide\n"
"add path 'zvol' unhide\n"
"add path 'zvol/zroot' unhide\n"
"add path 'zvol/zroot/vms' unhide\n"
"add path 'zvol/zroot/vms/bhyvevm0' unhide\n"
"add path 'zvol/zroot/vms/bhyvevm1' unhide\n"
"add path 'tap10*' unhide\n"
