#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Machine Consoles"
msgstr "虚拟机的终端"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2125
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is advantageous to wrap the bhyve console in a session management tool "
"such as package:sysutils/tmux[] or package:sysutils/screen[] in order to "
"detach and reattach to the console.  It is also possible to have the console "
"of bhyve be a null modem device that can be accessed with `cu`.  To do this, "
"load the [.filename]#nmdm# kernel module and replace `-l com1,stdio` with `-"
"l com1,/dev/nmdm0A`.  The [.filename]#/dev/nmdm# devices are created "
"automatically as needed, where each is a pair, corresponding to the two ends "
"of the null modem cable ([.filename]#/dev/nmdm0A# and [.filename]#/dev/"
"nmdm0B#).  See man:nmdm[4] for more information."
msgstr "建议使用 package:sysutils/tmux[] 或 package:sysutils/screen[] 等会话管理工具承载 bhyve 控制台，以便分离和重新连接控制台。也可以将 bhyve 控制台设置为可通过 `cu` 访问的空调制解调器设备。为此，请加载 [.filename]#nmdm# 内核模块，并将 `-l com1,stdio` 替换为 `-l com1,/dev/nmdm0A`。[.filename]#/dev/nmdm# 设备会按需自动创建，每个设备都是一对，分别对应空调制解调器电缆的两端（[.filename]#/dev/nmdm0A# 和 [.filename]#/dev/nmdm0B#）。更多信息请参阅 man:nmdm[4]。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2133
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# kldload nmdm\n"
"# bhyve -A -H -P -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc -s 2:0,virtio-net,tap0 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./linux.img \\\n"
"    -l com1,/dev/nmdm0A -c 4 -m 1024M linuxguest\n"
"# cu -l /dev/nmdm0B\n"
"Connected\n"
msgstr "# kldload nmdm\n# bhyve -A -H -P -s 0:0,hostbridge -s 1:0,lpc -s 2:0,virtio-net,tap0 -s 3:0,virtio-blk,./linux.img \\\n    -l com1,/dev/nmdm0A -c 4 -m 1024M linuxguest\n# cu -l /dev/nmdm0B\nConnected\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2135
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Ubuntu 13.10 handbook ttyS0\n"
msgstr "Ubuntu 13.10 handbook ttyS0\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2137
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "handbook login:\n"
msgstr "handbook login:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2143
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To disconnect from a console, enter a newline (i.e. press `RETURN`) followed "
"by tilde (`~`), and finally dot (`.`).  Keep in mind that only the "
"connection is dropped while the login session remains active.  Another user "
"connecting to the same console could therefore make use of any active "
"sessions without having to first authenticate.  For security reasons, it's "
"therefore recommended to logout before disconnecting."
msgstr "要断开控制台连接，请先输入换行符（即按 `RETURN`），然后输入波浪号（`~`），最后输入句点（`.`）。请注意，这只会断开连接，登录会话仍保持活动状态。因此，其他用户连接到同一控制台后，无需先进行身份验证即可使用任何活动会话。出于安全考虑，建议在断开连接前先注销。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2148
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The number in the [.filename]#nmdm# device path must be unique for each "
"virtual machine and must not be used by any other processes before bhyve "
"starts.  The number can be chosen arbitrarily and does not need to be taken "
"from a consecutive sequence of numbers.  The device node pair (i.e. [."
"filename]#/dev/nmdm0a# and [.filename]#/dev/nmdm0b#) are created dynamically "
"when bhyve connects its console and destroyed when it shuts down.  Keep this "
"in mind when creating scripts to start the virtual machines: make sure that "
"all virtual machines are assigned unique [.filename]#nmdm# devices."
msgstr "[.filename]#nmdm# 设备路径中的编号必须在每台虚拟机之间保持唯一，并且在 bhyve 启动前不能被其他进程使用。编号可以任意选择，不必按连续顺序分配。设备节点对（即 [.filename]#/dev/nmdm0a# 和 [.filename]#/dev/nmdm0b#）会在 bhyve 连接其控制台时动态创建，并在关闭时销毁。创建虚拟机启动脚本时请牢记这一点：确保为所有虚拟机分配唯一的 [.filename]#nmdm# 设备。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2150
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Virtual Machines"
msgstr "管理虚拟机"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2154
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A device node is created in [.filename]#/dev/vmm# for each virtual machine.  "
"This allows the administrator to easily see a list of the running virtual "
"machines:"
msgstr "每台虚拟机都会在 [.filename]#/dev/vmm# 中创建一个设备节点。管理员可借此轻松查看正在运行的虚拟机列表："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2164
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# ls -al /dev/vmm\n"
"total 1\n"
"dr-xr-xr-x   2 root  wheel    512 Mar 17 12:19 ./\n"
"dr-xr-xr-x  14 root  wheel    512 Mar 17 06:38 ../\n"
"crw-------   1 root  wheel  0x1a2 Mar 17 12:20 guestname\n"
"crw-------   1 root  wheel  0x19f Mar 17 12:19 linuxguest\n"
"crw-------   1 root  wheel  0x1a1 Mar 17 12:19 otherguest\n"
msgstr "# ls -al /dev/vmm\ntotal 1\ndr-xr-xr-x   2 root  wheel    512 Mar 17 12:19 ./\ndr-xr-xr-x  14 root  wheel    512 Mar 17 06:38 ../\ncrw-------   1 root  wheel  0x1a2 Mar 17 12:20 guestname\ncrw-------   1 root  wheel  0x19f Mar 17 12:19 linuxguest\ncrw-------   1 root  wheel  0x1a1 Mar 17 12:19 otherguest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2167
#, fuzzy
msgid "A specified virtual machine can be destroyed using `bhyvectl`:"
msgstr "可以使用 `bhyvectl` 销毁指定的虚拟机："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2171
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# bhyvectl --destroy --vm=guestname\n"
msgstr "# bhyvectl --destroy --vm=guestname\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2175
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Destroying a virtual machine this way means killing it immediately. Any "
"unsaved data will be lost, open files and filesystems may get corrupted.  To "
"gracefully shut down a virtual machine, send a `TERM` signal to its bhyve "
"process instead. This triggers an ACPI shutdown event for the guest:"
msgstr "以这种方式销毁虚拟机意味着立即终止它。所有未保存的数据都会丢失，打开的文件和文件系统也可能损坏。要正常关闭虚拟机，请向其 bhyve 进程发送 `TERM` 信号。这会向客户机触发 ACPI 关机事件："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2181
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# ps ax | grep bhyve\n"
"17424  -  SC      56:48.27 bhyve: guestvm (bhyve)\n"
"# kill 17424\n"
msgstr "# ps ax | grep bhyve\n17424  -  SC      56:48.27 bhyve: guestvm (bhyve)\n# kill 17424\n"

