#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2229
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In order to configure the system to start bhyve guests at boot time, some "
"configuration file changes are required."
msgstr "要将系统配置为在启动时启动 bhyve 客户机，需要更改一些配置文件。"

#. type: .procedure
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2232
#, fuzzy
msgid "[.filename]#/etc/sysctl.conf#"
msgstr "[.filename]#/etc/sysctl.conf#"

#. type: .procedure
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2234
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When using [.filename]#tap# interfaces as network backend, either manually "
"set each used [.filename]#tap# interface to UP or simply set the following "
"sysctl:"
msgstr "使用 [.filename]#tap# 接口作为网络后端时，可手动将每个使用的 [.filename]#tap# 接口设为 UP，或者直接设置以下 sysctl："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2238
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "net.link.tap.up_on_open=1\n"
msgstr "net.link.tap.up_on_open=1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2241
#, fuzzy
msgid "[.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#"
msgstr "[.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2245
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To connect the virtual machine's [.filename]#tap# device to the network via "
"a [.filename]#bridge#, persisting the device settings in [.filename]#/etc/rc."
"conf# is needed.  Additionally, load the necessary kernel modules `vmm` for "
"bhyve and `nmdm` for [.filename]#nmdm# devices through the `kld_list` "
"configuration variable.  When configuring `ifconfig_bridge0`, make sure to "
"replace `<ipaddr>/<netmask>` with the actual IP address of the physical "
"interface ([.filename]#igb0# in this example) and remove IP settings from "
"the physical device."
msgstr "要通过 [.filename]#bridge# 将虚拟机的 [.filename]#tap# 设备连接到网络，需要在 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 中持久化设备设置。此外，请通过 `kld_list` 配置变量加载 bhyve 所需的内核模块 `vmm`，以及 [.filename]#nmdm# 设备所需的 `nmdm`。配置 `ifconfig_bridge0` 时，请将 `<ipaddr>/<netmask>` 替换为物理接口的实际 IP 地址（本例中为 [.filename]#igb0#），并从物理设备中移除 IP 设置。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2252
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# sysrc cloned_interfaces+=\"bridge0 tap0\"\n"
"# sysrc ifconfig_bridge0=\"inet <ipaddr>/<netmask> addm igb0 addm tap0\"\n"
"# sysrc kld_list+=\"nmdm vmm\"\n"
"# sysrc ifconfig_igb0=\"up\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc cloned_interfaces+=\"bridge0 tap0\"\n# sysrc ifconfig_bridge0=\"inet <ipaddr>/<netmask> addm igb0 addm tap0\"\n# sysrc kld_list+=\"nmdm vmm\"\n# sysrc ifconfig_igb0=\"up\"\n"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2255
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Setting the IP for a bridge device"
msgstr "设置网桥设备的 IP 地址"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2259
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For a host with an _igb0_ interface connected to the network with IP "
"`10.10.10.1` and netmask `255.255.255.0`, use the following commands:"
msgstr "对于接口 _igb0_ 已连接到网络、IP 地址为 `10.10.10.1` 且子网掩码为 `255.255.255.0` 的主机，请使用以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2266
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# sysrc ifconfig_igb0=\"up\"\n"
"# sysrc ifconfig_bridge0=\"inet 10.10.10.1/24 addm igb0 addm tap0\"\n"
"# sysrc kld_list+=\"nmdm vmm\"\n"
"# sysrc cloned_interfaces+=\"bridge0 tap0\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc ifconfig_igb0=\"up\"\n# sysrc ifconfig_bridge0=\"inet 10.10.10.1/24 addm igb0 addm tap0\"\n# sysrc kld_list+=\"nmdm vmm\"\n# sysrc cloned_interfaces+=\"bridge0 tap0\"\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2273
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Modifying the IP address configuration of a system may terminate the current "
"remote connection (e.g., via SSH), causing a lock out.  Take precautions to "
"maintain system access or make those modifications while logged in on a "
"local terminal session."
msgstr "修改系统的 IP 地址配置可能会终止当前的远程连接（例如通过 SSH 的连接），导致无法继续访问系统。请采取措施确保仍可访问系统，或者在本地终端会话中登录时进行这些修改。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2276
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "FreeBSD as a Xen(TM)-Host"
msgstr "FreeBSD 作为 Xen(TM) 主机"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2281
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Xen is a GPLv2-licensed https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Hypervisor#Classification[type 1 hypervisor] for Intel(R) and ARM(R) "
"architectures.  FreeBSD has included i386(TM) and AMD(R) 64-Bit https://wiki."
"xenproject.org/wiki/DomU[DomU] and https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Amazon_Elastic_Compute_Cloud[Amazon EC2] unprivileged domain (virtual "
"machine) support since FreeBSD 8.0 and includes Dom0 control domain (host) "
"support in FreeBSD 11.0.  Support for para-virtualized (PV) domains has been "
"removed from FreeBSD 11 in favor of hardware virtualized (HVM) domains, "
"which provides better performance."
msgstr "Xen 是适用于 Intel(R) 和 ARM(R) 架构、采用 GPLv2 许可的 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypervisor#Classification[1 型虚拟机监控程序]。自 FreeBSD 8.0 起，FreeBSD 已支持 i386(TM) 和 AMD(R) 64 位 link:https://wiki.xenproject.org/wiki/DomU[DomU] 及 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amazon_Elastic_Compute_Cloud[Amazon EC2] 非特权域（虚拟机）；FreeBSD 11.0 则加入了 Dom0 控制域（主机）支持。FreeBSD 11 已移除对半虚拟化（PV）域的支持，转而支持硬件虚拟化（HVM）域，以提供更好的性能。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2289
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Xen(TM) is a bare-metal hypervisor, which means that it is the first program "
"loaded after the BIOS.  A special privileged guest called the Domain-0 "
"(`Dom0` for short) is then started.  The Dom0 uses its special privileges to "
"directly access the underlying physical hardware, making it a high-"
"performance solution.  It is able to access the disk controllers and network "
"adapters directly.  The Xen(TM) management tools to manage and control the "
"Xen(TM) hypervisor are also used by the Dom0 to create, list, and destroy "
"VMs.  Dom0 provides virtual disks and networking for unprivileged domains, "
"often called `DomU`.  Xen(TM) Dom0 can be compared to the service console of "
"other hypervisor solutions, while the DomU is where individual guest VMs are "
"run."
msgstr ""
"<trademark>Xen</trademark>是一个裸机管理程序，这意味着它是BIOS之后加载的第一"
"个程序。然后启动一个名为Domain-0的特殊特权客体（简称为<literal>Dom0</"
"literal>）。Dom0利用其特殊权限直接访问底层物理硬件，使其成为高性能的解决方"
"案。它能够直接访问磁盘控制器和网络适配器。Dom0还可以使用<trademark>Xen</"
"trademark>管理工具来管理和控制<trademark>Xen</trademark>虚拟机，用于创建、列"
"出和销毁虚拟机。Dom0为非特权域提供虚拟磁盘和网络，通常被称为<literal>DomU</"
"literal>。<trademark>Xen</trademark> Dom0可以与其他虚拟机解决方案的服务控制台"
"相提并论，而DomU则是运行单个访客虚拟机的地方。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2296
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Xen(TM) can migrate VMs between different Xen(TM) servers.  When the two xen "
"hosts share the same underlying storage, the migration can be done without "
"having to shut the VM down first.  Instead, the migration is performed live "
"while the DomU is running and there is no need to restart it or plan a "
"downtime.  This is useful in maintenance scenarios or upgrade windows to "
"ensure that the services provided by the DomU are still provided.  Many more "
"features of Xen(TM) are listed on the https://wiki.xenproject.org/wiki/"
"Category:Overview[Xen Wiki Overview page].  Note that not all features are "
"supported on FreeBSD yet."
msgstr "Xen(TM) 可以在不同的 Xen(TM) 服务器之间迁移虚拟机。如果两台 Xen 主机使用相同的底层存储，迁移时无需先关闭虚拟机。迁移会在 DomU 运行期间实时进行，因此无需重启，也不必安排停机时间。这在维护或升级期间很有用，可以确保 DomU 提供的服务持续运行。Xen(TM) 的更多功能列于 link:https://wiki.xenproject.org/wiki/Category:Overview[Xen Wiki 概览页面]。请注意，FreeBSD 尚未支持所有功能。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2298
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Hardware Requirements for Xen(TM) Dom0"
msgstr "Xen(TM) Dom0 的硬件要求"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2302
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To run the Xen(TM) hypervisor on a host, certain hardware functionality is "
"required.  Running FreeBSD as a Xen host (Dom0) require Intel Extended Page "
"Tables (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Extended_Page_Table[EPT]) or AMD "
"Nested Page Tables (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Rapid_Virtualization_Indexing[NPT]) and Input/Output Memory Management Unit "
"(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_IOMMU-supporting_hardware[IOMMU]) "
"support in the host processor."
msgstr "要在主机上运行 Xen(TM) 虚拟机监控程序，需要具备某些硬件功能。要将 FreeBSD 用作 Xen 主机（Dom0），主机处理器必须支持 Intel 扩展页表（ link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Extended_Page_Table[EPT]）或 AMD 嵌套页表（ link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rapid_Virtualization_Indexing[NPT]），以及输入/输出内存管理单元（ link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_IOMMU-supporting_hardware[IOMMU]）。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2307
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In order to run a FreeBSD 13 Xen(TM) Dom0 the box must be booted using "
"legacy boot (BIOS).  FreeBSD 14 and newer supports booting as a Xen(TM) Dom0 "
"in both BIOS and UEFI modes."
msgstr "要运行 FreeBSD 13 Xen(TM) Dom0，必须以传统启动模式（BIOS）启动计算机。FreeBSD 14 及更高版本支持在 BIOS 和 UEFI 模式下启动为 Xen(TM) Dom0。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2310
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Xen(TM) Dom0 Control Domain Setup"
msgstr "Xen(TM) Dom0 控制域设置"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2313
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Users should install the package:emulators/xen-kernel[] and package:sysutils/"
"xen-tools[] packages, based on Xen(TM) 4.18."
msgstr "用户应安装基于 Xen(TM) 4.18 的 package:emulators/xen-kernel[] 和 package:sysutils/xen-tools[] 软件包。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2317
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Configuration files must be edited to prepare the host for the Dom0 "
"integration after the Xen packages are installed.  An entry to [.filename]#/"
"etc/sysctl.conf# disables the limit on how many pages of memory are allowed "
"to be wired.  Otherwise, DomU VMs with higher memory requirements will not "
"run."
msgstr ""
"必须编辑配置文件，以便在安装 Xen 包后为主机集成 Dom0。<filename>/etc/sysctl."
"conf</filename>中的一个条目将禁用允许连接的内存页数限制。否则，对内存要求较高"
"的 DomU 虚拟机将无法运行。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2321
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# echo 'vm.max_wired=-1' >> /etc/sysctl.conf\n"
msgstr "# echo 'vm.max_wired=-1' >> /etc/sysctl.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2327
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Another memory-related setting involves changing [.filename]#/etc/login."
"conf#, setting the `memorylocked` option to `unlimited`.  Otherwise, "
"creating DomU domains may fail with `Cannot allocate memory` errors.  After "
"making the change to [.filename]#/etc/login.conf#, run `cap_mkdb` to update "
"the capability database.  See crossref:security[security-resourcelimits,"
"\"Resource Limits\"] for details."
msgstr "另一项与内存相关的设置是修改 [.filename]#/etc/login.conf#，将 `memorylocked` 选项设为 `unlimited`。否则，创建 DomU 域时可能会出现 `Cannot allocate memory` 错误。修改 [.filename]#/etc/login.conf# 后，运行 `cap_mkdb` 以更新能力数据库。详情请参见 crossref:security[security-resourcelimits,\"Resource Limits\"]。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2332
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# sed -i '' -e 's/memorylocked=64K/memorylocked=unlimited/' /etc/login.conf\n"
"# cap_mkdb /etc/login.conf\n"
msgstr "# sed -i '' -e 's/memorylocked=64K/memorylocked=unlimited/' /etc/login.conf\n# cap_mkdb /etc/login.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2335
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add an entry for the Xen(TM) console to [.filename]#/etc/ttys#:"
msgstr "在 [.filename]#/etc/ttys# 中添加 Xen(TM) 控制台条目："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2339
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# echo 'xc0     \"/usr/libexec/getty Pc\"         xterm   onifconsole  secure' >> /etc/ttys\n"
msgstr "# echo 'xc0     \"/usr/libexec/getty Pc\"         xterm   onifconsole  secure' >> /etc/ttys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2346
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Selecting a Xen(TM) kernel in [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# activates the "
"Dom0.  Xen(TM) also requires resources like CPU and memory from the host "
"machine for itself and other DomU domains.  How much CPU and memory depends "
"on the individual requirements and hardware capabilities.  In this example, "
"8 GB of memory and 4 virtual CPUs are made available for the Dom0.  The "
"serial console is also activated, and logging options are defined."
msgstr ""
"在<filename>/boot/loader.conf</filename>中选择<trademark>Xen</trademark>内"
"核，会激活Dom0。<trademark>Xen</trademark>也需要主机上的资源，如CPU和内存等资"
"源，用于自己和其他 DomU域。CPU 和内存的多少取决于个人需求和硬件能力。在本例"
"中，为 Dom0 提供了 8GB 内存和 4 个虚拟 CPU。串行控制台也被激活，并定义了记录"
"选项。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2348
msgid "The following command is used for Xen 4.7 packages:"
msgstr "以下命令用于 Xen 4.7 包："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2355
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# echo 'hw.pci.mcfg=0' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"
"# echo 'if_tap_load=\"YES\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"
"# echo 'xen_kernel=\"/boot/xen\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"
"# echo 'xen_cmdline=\"dom0_mem=8192M dom0_max_vcpus=4 dom0pvh=1 console=com1,vga com1=115200,8n1 guest_loglvl=all loglvl=all\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"
msgstr "# echo 'hw.pci.mcfg=0' >> /boot/loader.conf\n# echo 'if_tap_load=\"YES\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n# echo 'xen_kernel=\"/boot/xen\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n# echo 'xen_cmdline=\"dom0_mem=8192M dom0_max_vcpus=4 dom0pvh=1 console=com1,vga com1=115200,8n1 guest_loglvl=all loglvl=all\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2358
msgid ""
"For Xen versions 4.11 and higher, the following command should be used "
"instead:"
msgstr "Xen 4.11 及以上版本应使用以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2364
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# echo 'if_tap_load=\"YES\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"
"# echo 'xen_kernel=\"/boot/xen\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"
"# echo 'xen_cmdline=\"dom0_mem=8192M dom0_max_vcpus=4 dom0=pvh console=com1,vga com1=115200,8n1 guest_loglvl=all loglvl=all\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"
msgstr "# echo 'if_tap_load=\"YES\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n# echo 'xen_kernel=\"/boot/xen\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n# echo 'xen_cmdline=\"dom0_mem=8192M dom0_max_vcpus=4 dom0=pvh console=com1,vga com1=115200,8n1 guest_loglvl=all loglvl=all\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2371
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Log files that Xen(TM) creates for the DomU VMs are stored in [.filename]#/"
"var/log/xen#.  Please be sure to check the contents of that directory if "
"experiencing issues."
msgstr "Xen(TM) 为 DomU 虚拟机创建的日志文件存储在 [.filename]#/var/log/xen# 中。遇到问题时，请务必检查该目录的内容。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2374
msgid "Activate the xencommons service during system startup:"
msgstr "在系统启动时启动 xencommons 服务："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2378
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc xencommons_enable=yes\n"
msgstr "# sysrc xencommons_enable=yes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2384
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These settings are enough to start a Dom0-enabled system.  However, it lacks "
"network functionality for the DomU machines.  To fix that, define a bridged "
"interface with the main NIC of the system which the DomU VMs can use to "
"connect to the network.  Replace _em0_ with the host network interface name."
msgstr ""
"这些设置足以启动一个支持Dom0的系统。但是，它缺乏DomU机器的网络功能。要解决这"
"个问题，请定义一个与系统的主网卡的桥接接口，DomU虚拟机可以用它来连接到网络。"
"将<replaceable>em0</replaceable>替换为主机网络接口名称。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2390
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# sysrc cloned_interfaces=\"bridge0\"\n"
"# sysrc ifconfig_bridge0=\"addm em0 SYNCDHCP\"\n"
"# sysrc ifconfig_em0=\"up\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc cloned_interfaces=\"bridge0\"\n# sysrc ifconfig_bridge0=\"addm em0 SYNCDHCP\"\n# sysrc ifconfig_em0=\"up\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2393
#, fuzzy
msgid "Restart the host to load the Xen(TM) kernel and start the Dom0."
msgstr "重启主机以加载 Xen(TM) 内核并启动 Dom0。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2397
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# shutdown -r now\n"
msgstr "# shutdown -r now\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2400
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After successfully booting the Xen(TM) kernel and logging into the system "
"again, the Xen(TM) management tool `xl` is used to show information about "
"the domains."
msgstr "成功启动 Xen(TM) 内核并重新登录系统后，可以使用 Xen(TM) 管理工具 `xl` 查看域信息。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2406
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# xl list\n"
"Name                                        ID   Mem VCPUs      State   Time(s)\n"
"Domain-0                                     0  8192     4     r-----     962.0\n"
msgstr "# xl list\nName                                        ID   Mem VCPUs      State   Time(s)\nDomain-0                                     0  8192     4     r-----     962.0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2412
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The output confirms that the Dom0 (called `Domain-0`) has the ID `0` and is "
"running.  It also has the memory and virtual CPUs that were defined in [."
"filename]#/boot/loader.conf# earlier.  More information can be found in the "
"https://www.xenproject.org/help/documentation.html[Xen(TM) Documentation].  "
"DomU guest VMs can now be created."
msgstr "输出确认 Dom0（名为 `Domain-0`）的 ID 为 `0`，且正在运行。它还具有先前在 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# 中配置的内存和虚拟 CPU。更多信息请参见 link:https://www.xenproject.org/help/documentation.html[Xen(TM) 文档]。现在可以创建 DomU 客户机虚拟机。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2414
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Xen(TM) DomU Guest VM Configuration"
msgstr "Xen(TM) DomU 客户机虚拟机配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2421
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Unprivileged domains consist of a configuration file and virtual or physical "
"hard disks.  Virtual disk storage for the DomU can be files created by man:"
"truncate[1] or ZFS volumes as described in crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs-"
"volume,“Creating and Destroying Volumes”].  In this example, a 20 GB volume "
"is used.  A VM is created with the ZFS volume, a FreeBSD ISO image, 1 GB of "
"RAM and two virtual CPUs.  The ISO installation file is retrieved with man:"
"fetch[1] and saved locally in a file called [.filename]#freebsd.iso#."
msgstr "非特权域由配置文件以及虚拟或物理硬盘组成。DomU 的虚拟磁盘存储可以是通过 man:truncate[1] 创建的文件，也可以是 crossref:zfs[zfs-zfs-volume,“创建和销毁卷”] 中所述的 ZFS 卷。本例使用一个 20 GB 的卷。使用该 ZFS 卷、FreeBSD ISO 映像、1 GB 内存和两个虚拟 CPU 创建虚拟机。使用 man:fetch[1] 获取 ISO 安装文件，并将其保存到名为 [.filename]#freebsd.iso# 的本地文件中。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2425
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# fetch https://download.freebsd.org/releases/ISO-IMAGES/14.0/FreeBSD-14.0-RELEASE-amd64-bootonly.iso -o freebsd.iso\n"
msgstr "# fetch https://download.freebsd.org/releases/ISO-IMAGES/14.0/FreeBSD-14.0-RELEASE-amd64-bootonly.iso -o freebsd.iso\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2428
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A ZFS volume of 20 GB called [.filename]#xendisk0# is created to serve as "
"the disk space for the VM."
msgstr ""
"创建名为<filename>xendisk0</filename>的 20 GB 的 ZFS 卷，用作 VM 的磁盘空间。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2432
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# zfs create -V20G -o volmode=dev zroot/xendisk0\n"
msgstr "# zfs create -V20G -o volmode=dev zroot/xendisk0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2437
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The new DomU guest VM is defined in a file.  Some specific definitions like "
"name, keymap, and VNC connection details are also defined.  The following [."
"filename]#freebsd.cfg# contains a minimum DomU configuration for this "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"新的 DomU guest VM定义在一个文件中。还定义了一些特定的配置，如名称、密钥映射"
"和VNC连接细节。下面的<filename>freebsd.cfg</filename>包含了本例中的最低限度"
"的 DomU 配置："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2454
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cat freebsd.cfg\n"
"builder = \"hvm\" <.>\n"
"name = \"freebsd\" <.>\n"
"memory = 1024 <.>\n"
"vcpus = 2 <.>\n"
"vif = [ 'mac=00:16:3E:74:34:32,bridge=bridge0' ] <.>\n"
"disk = [\n"
"'/dev/zvol/tank/xendisk0,raw,hda,rw', <.>\n"
"'/root/freebsd.iso,raw,hdc:cdrom,r' <.>\n"
"  ]\n"
"vnc = 1 <.>\n"
"vnclisten = \"0.0.0.0\"\n"
"serial = \"pty\"\n"
"usbdevice = \"tablet\"\n"
msgstr "# cat freebsd.cfg\nbuilder = \"hvm\" <.>\nname = \"freebsd\" <.>\nmemory = 1024 <.>\nvcpus = 2 <.>\nvif = [ 'mac=00:16:3E:74:34:32,bridge=bridge0' ] <.>\ndisk = [\n'/dev/zvol/tank/xendisk0,raw,hda,rw', <.>\n'/root/freebsd.iso,raw,hdc:cdrom,r' <.>\n  ]\nvnc = 1 <.>\nvnclisten = \"0.0.0.0\"\nserial = \"pty\"\nusbdevice = \"tablet\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2457
msgid "These lines are explained in more detail:"
msgstr "接下来详细介绍上面的命令："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2459
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This defines what kind of virtualization to use. `hvm` refers to hardware-"
"assisted virtualization or hardware virtual machine. Guest operating systems "
"can run unmodified on CPUs with virtualization extensions, providing nearly "
"the same performance as running on physical hardware. `generic` is the "
"default value and creates a PV domain."
msgstr "这定义了要使用的虚拟化类型。`hvm` 表示硬件辅助虚拟化或硬件虚拟机。启用了虚拟化扩展的 CPU 可以运行未经修改的客户机操作系统，其性能几乎与在物理硬件上运行相同。`generic` 是默认值，会创建 PV 域。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2460
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Name of this virtual machine to distinguish it from others running on the "
"same Dom0. Required."
msgstr "用于区分同一 Dom0 上其他虚拟机的虚拟机名称。必需。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2461
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quantity of RAM in megabytes to make available to the VM. This amount is "
"subtracted from the hypervisor's total available memory, not the memory of "
"the Dom0."
msgstr "为虚拟机分配的内存量，单位为兆字节。此数量从虚拟机监控程序的总可用内存中扣除，而不是从 Dom0 的内存中扣除。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2462
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Number of virtual CPUs available to the guest VM. For best performance, do "
"not create guests with more virtual CPUs than the number of physical CPUs on "
"the host."
msgstr "客户机虚拟机可用的虚拟 CPU 数量。为获得最佳性能，创建客户机时，其虚拟 CPU 数量不应超过主机的物理 CPU 数量。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2463
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Virtual network adapter. This is the bridge connected to the network "
"interface of the host. The `mac` parameter is the MAC address set on the "
"virtual network interface. This parameter is optional, if no MAC is provided "
"Xen(TM) will generate a random one."
msgstr "虚拟网络适配器。它是连接到主机网络接口的网桥。`mac` 参数是为虚拟网络接口设置的 MAC 地址。此参数可选；如果未提供 MAC 地址，Xen(TM) 会随机生成一个。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2464
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Full path to the disk, file, or ZFS volume of the disk storage for this VM. "
"Options and multiple disk definitions are separated by commas."
msgstr "此虚拟机磁盘存储所用磁盘、文件或 ZFS 卷的完整路径。多个选项和磁盘定义之间用逗号分隔。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2465
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Defines the Boot medium from which the initial operating system is "
"installed. In this example, it is the ISO image downloaded earlier. Consult "
"the Xen(TM) documentation for other kinds of devices and options to set."
msgstr "定义安装初始操作系统所用的启动介质。本例中使用的是之前下载的 ISO 映像。有关可设置的其他设备类型和选项，请参阅 Xen(TM) 文档。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2466
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Options controlling VNC connectivity to the serial console of the DomU. In "
"order, these are: active VNC support, define IP address on which to listen, "
"device node for the serial console, and the input method for precise "
"positioning of the mouse and other input methods. `keymap` defines which "
"keymap to use, and is `english` by default."
msgstr "控制 DomU 串行控制台 VNC 连接的选项。依次为：启用 VNC 支持、指定监听 IP 地址、串行控制台的设备节点，以及用于精确定位鼠标和其他输入的输入方法。`keymap` 用于定义所用的键盘映射，默认值为 `english`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2468
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After the file has been created with all the necessary options, the DomU is "
"created by passing it to `xl create` as a parameter."
msgstr "创建包含所有必要选项的文件后，将该文件作为参数传给 `xl create`，即可创建 DomU。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2472
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# xl create freebsd.cfg\n"
msgstr "# xl create freebsd.cfg\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2481
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Each time the Dom0 is restarted, the configuration file must be passed to "
"`xl create` again to re-create the DomU.  By default, only the Dom0 is "
"created after a reboot, not the individual VMs.  The VMs can continue where "
"they left off as they stored the operating system on the virtual disk.  The "
"virtual machine configuration can change over time (for example, when adding "
"more memory).  The virtual machine configuration files must be properly "
"backed up and kept available to be able to re-create the guest VM when "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"每次重启Dom0时，必须再次将配置文件传递给<command>xl create</command>以重新创"
"建 DomU。默认情况下，重启后只创建 Dom0，不创建单个虚拟机。虚拟机可以还原到被"
"暂停的那一刻，因为它们在虚拟磁盘上存储了操作系统。虚拟机配置可以随时改变（例"
"如，增加更多内存时）。必须妥善备份虚拟机配置文件并保持可用，以便在需要时重建"
"虚拟机。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2484
#, fuzzy
msgid "The output of `xl list` confirms that the DomU has been created."
msgstr "`xl list` 的输出确认 DomU 已创建。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2491
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# xl list\n"
"Name                                        ID   Mem VCPUs      State   Time(s)\n"
"Domain-0                                     0  8192     4     r-----  1653.4\n"
"freebsd                                      1  1024     1     -b----   663.9\n"
msgstr "# xl list\nName                                        ID   Mem VCPUs      State   Time(s)\nDomain-0                                     0  8192     4     r-----  1653.4\nfreebsd                                      1  1024     1     -b----   663.9\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2498
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To begin the installation of the base operating system, start the VNC "
"client, directing it to the main network address of the host or to the IP "
"address defined on the `vnclisten` line of [.filename]#freebsd.cfg#.  After "
"the operating system has been installed, shut down the DomU and disconnect "
"the VNC viewer.  Edit [.filename]#freebsd.cfg#, removing the line with the "
"`cdrom` definition or commenting it out by inserting a `+#+` character at "
"the beginning of the line.  To load this new configuration, it is necessary "
"to remove the old DomU with `xl destroy`, passing either the name or the id "
"as the parameter.  Afterwards, recreate it using the modified [."
"filename]*freebsd.cfg*."
msgstr ""
"要开始安装基础操作系统，请启动VNC客户端，将其引导到主机的主网络地址或"
"<filename>freebsd.cfg</filename>中<literal>vnclisten</literal>行中定义的IP地"
"址。安装好操作系统后，关闭 DomU 并断开 VNC 查看器的连接。编辑"
"<filename>freebsd.cfg</filename>，删除带有<literal>cdrom</literal>定义的那"
"行，或者在该行的开头插入一个<literal>#</literal>字符，将其注释掉。要加载这个"
"新配置，必须用<command>xl destroy</command>来删除旧的DomU，传递名称或id作为参"
"数。然后，使用修改后的<filename>freebsd.cfg</filename>重新创建。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2503
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# xl destroy freebsd\n"
"# xl create freebsd.cfg\n"
msgstr "# xl destroy freebsd\n# xl create freebsd.cfg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2507
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The machine can then be accessed again using the VNC viewer. This time, "
#| "it will boot from the virtual disk where the operating system has been "
#| "installed and can be used as a virtual machine."
msgid ""
"The machine can then be accessed again using the VNC viewer.  This time, it "
"will boot from the virtual disk where the operating system has been "
"installed and can be used as a virtual machine."
msgstr ""
"然后可以使用VNC再次访问该机器。这时，它将从安装了操作系统的虚拟磁盘启动，可以"
"作为虚拟机使用。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2509
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2512
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section contains basic information in order to help troubleshoot issues "
"found when using FreeBSD as a Xen(TM) host or guest."
msgstr "本节介绍基本信息，帮助排查将 FreeBSD 用作 Xen(TM) 主机或客户机时遇到的问题。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2514
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host Boot Troubleshooting"
msgstr "启动故障排除（Host）"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2518
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Please note that the following troubleshooting tips are intended for Xen(TM) "
"4.11 or newer.  When still using Xen(TM) 4.7 and having issues, consider "
"migrating to a newer version of Xen(TM)."
msgstr "请注意，以下故障排除提示适用于 Xen(TM) 4.11 或更高版本。如果仍在使用 Xen(TM) 4.7 并遇到问题，请考虑迁移到较新版本的 Xen(TM)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2522
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In order to troubleshoot host boot issues, a serial cable or a debug USB "
"cable is needed.  Verbose Xen(TM) boot output can be obtained by adding "
"options to the `xen_cmdline` option found in [.filename]#loader.conf#.  A "
"couple of relevant debug options are:"
msgstr "要排查主机启动问题，需要串行线缆或调试用 USB 线缆。可通过向 [.filename]#loader.conf# 中的 `xen_cmdline` 选项添加选项，获取 Xen(TM) 的详细启动输出。以下是一些相关的调试选项："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2524
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`iommu=debug`: can be used to print additional diagnostic information about "
"the iommu."
msgstr "`iommu=debug`：可用于打印有关 iommu 的更多诊断信息。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2525
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`dom0=verbose`: can be used to print additional diagnostic information about "
"the dom0 build process."
msgstr "`dom0=verbose`：可用于打印有关 dom0 构建过程的更多诊断信息。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2526
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`sync_console`: flag to force synchronous console output. Useful for "
"debugging to avoid losing messages due to rate limiting. Never use this "
"option in production environments since it can allow malicious guests to "
"perform DoS attacks against Xen(TM) using the console."
msgstr "`sync_console`：强制控制台同步输出的标志。此选项有助于调试，避免因速率限制而丢失消息。切勿在生产环境中使用此选项，因为恶意客户机可能利用控制台对 Xen(TM) 发起 DoS 攻击。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2529
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "FreeBSD should also be booted in verbose mode in order to identify any "
#| "issues. To activate verbose booting, run this command:"
msgid ""
"FreeBSD should also be booted in verbose mode in order to identify any "
"issues.  To activate verbose booting, run this command:"
msgstr ""
"FreeBSD 也应该在 verbose 模式下启动， 以便识别任何问题。要激活verbose "
"booting， 请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2533
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# echo 'boot_verbose=\"YES\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"
msgstr "# echo 'boot_verbose=\"YES\"' >> /boot/loader.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2536
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If none of these options help solving the problem, please send the serial "
"boot log to mailto:freebsd-xen@FreeBSD.org[freebsd-xen@FreeBSD.org] and "
"mailto:xen-devel@lists.xenproject.org[xen-devel@lists.xenproject.org] for "
"further analysis."
msgstr "如果这些选项都无法解决问题，请将串行启动日志发送至 mailto:freebsd-xen@FreeBSD.org[freebsd-xen@FreeBSD.org] 和 mailto:xen-devel@lists.xenproject.org[xen-devel@lists.xenproject.org]，以供进一步分析。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2538
#, no-wrap
msgid "Guest Creation Troubleshooting"
msgstr "客户机创建故障疑难解答"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2541
msgid ""
"Issues can also arise when creating guests, the following attempts to "
"provide some help for those trying to diagnose guest creation issues."
msgstr ""
"创建来宾时也会出现问题，以下尝试为那些尝试诊断来宾创建问题的人提供一些帮助。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/virtualization/_index.adoc:2544
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The most common cause of guest creation failures is the `xl` command "
"spitting some error and exiting with a return code different than 0.  If the "
"error provided is not enough to help identify the issue, more verbose output "
"can also be obtained from `xl` by using the `v` option repeatedly."
msgstr ""
"最常见的原因是 <literal>xl</literal>命令吐出一些错误，退出时返回值不为 0。 如"
"果提供的错误还不足以帮助识别问题，还可以通过使用<literal>xl</literal>的"
"<literal>v</literal>选项获取更详细的信息。"

